\textbf{Dimension} & \textbf{Values} & \textbf{Question it answers} & \textbf{Used in} \\
\midrule
Stage & \stage{1}--\stage{6}, \stage{$\ast$} & Where does the cause lie? & Tab.~\ref{tab:incidents}, \ref{tab:coverage} \\
Adversary & T1 predictor, T2 state recovery, T3 consumption, T4 subversion, T5 integration & How is the weakness exploited? & Tab.~\ref{tab:incidents} \\
Access & A1 remote, A2 local, A3 supply chain & What must the attacker have? & Tab.~\ref{tab:threatmatrix}, \ref{tab:incidents} \\
